# Only agentz-react/ is needed to build the site. Everything below is source
# material or tooling that would otherwise be uploaded on every deploy: the old
# static site's media (29M), the raw screen recordings (74M), and the press kit.
#
# Leading slashes matter. These follow .gitignore matching, so a bare `assets/`
# would also match agentz-react/public/assets/ and strip every image and video
# out of the build.
/assets/
/tour-clips/
/marketing/
/.claude/
/CLAUDE.md
/agentz-react/test/
/agentz-react/README.md
/video-originals/
/image-originals/
